name lambdax
category Package
revision 60278
shortdesc Use Lambda expression within LaTeX
longdesc This package provides Lambda expressions. It is an interface to
longdesc specify the parameters and replacement code of a
longdesc document-command, and then to evaluate it with compatible
longdesc arguments. Optionally, it can be used recursively.
